gement. The candidate should also be able to teach emergency management courses at the graduate level, including research methods and guide emergency management doctoral students in their dissertation research. The candidate must be committed to teaching in different modalities, especially in an online format. Jax State offers the most comprehensive emergency management programs in the nation, from bachelor’s to doctorate levels. JSU's NASPAA-accredited MPA program is also unique in that it offers concentrations in political science, emergency management, criminal justice, GIS, and administrative management. Sign Up for Job Alerts Job Alert 7589421b Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Faculty Faculty Employment Type Faculty 12-Month (non-annual leave accruing) Faculty 12-Month (non-annual leave accruing) Locations Jacksonville, AL (CEPS Complex), Alabama, United States Jacksonville, AL (CEPS Complex), Alabama, United States First Name (required) 9e36257f Last Name (required) fca1c313 Email (required) 9ff97ad2 Send Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you 700 Pelham Rd N Jacksonville, AL 36265 Phone: 1-800-231-5291 or 1-256-782-5781 Email: info@jsu.edu Facebook Youtube Instagram © 2026 Jacksonville State University Cookie Preferences Candidate Details We use cookies Some are necessary to operate the website and its functions. Others help personalise, improve content and services to show you the most relevant job opportunities. With the decision \"Accept essential only\" we will respect your privacy and will not set cookies that aren't necessary for the operation of the site. Accept essential only Accept all Please choose the location(s)"
